  "story": {
    "day": 86,
    "title": "Kaya's Fair Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya wore her jogging suit and cap to visit the busy school fair.",
      "She walked between many brightly colored stalls.",
      "She had thirty dollars and wanted to pay for a souvenir.",
      "\"How much change will I get?\" she thought.",
      "She liked a story about a witch's battle from the seventeenth century.",
      "A toy from the eighteenth century cost fourteen dollars.",
      "She found her place on the ninth bench.",
      "The blackboard listed the dance for the nineteenth group.",
      "The twentieth, twenty-first, and twenty-second groups came next.",
      "Prizes for the fortieth, fiftieth, sixtieth, seventieth, and eightieth place were displayed.",
      "The ninetieth and hundredth visitors got free religious books.",
      "Someday, Kaya hoped to win the thousandth prize."
    ]
  }
